{"meta":{"id":"tt0330793","type":"movie","name":"El Castigador","imdb_id":"tt0330793","description":"Frank Castle es un agente secreto del FBI que hasta el momento ha logrado una carrera intachable. Frank también es un ex operativo de las Fuerzas Especiales. Finalmente sale del campo de batalla para trabajar en una oficina y así poder tener una vida normal con su esposa e hijo. Será entonces cuando el mundo de Frank se viene abajo por el peor temor que siempre tuvo: Su familia es ejecutada como repercusión de su último trabajo. Ahora Frank Castle busca castigar a los asesinos, para encontrar al final lo que menos esperaba: La redención.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0330793.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ziexSS07RmowuyqAdJMh1sGxjHg.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4CAYwc2qJ91kMOJB0KhtJn8WAbh.png","genres":["Acción","Crimen","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2004","released":"2004-04-15T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"140 min","imdbRating":"6.4","country":"Germany, United States of America","cast":["Thomas Jane","John Travolta","Will Patton","Roy Scheider","Laura Harring","Ben Foster","Samantha Mathis","James Carpinello","A. Russell Andrews","Eddie Jemison","John Pinette","Rebecca Romijn","Mark Collie","Marcus Johns","Omar Avila","Russell Durham Comegys","Antoni Corone","Rick Elmhurst","Carleth Keys","Michael Reardon","William Haze","Marco St. John","Bonnie Johnson","Veryl Jones","Jim Meskimen","Jack Swanson","Alan Lilly","Terry Loughlin","Marc Macaulay","Kevin Nash"],"director":["Jonathan Hensleigh"],"writer":["Gerry Conway","Jonathan Hensleigh","Michael France"],"trailers":[{"source":"TqVSFchQEyM","type":"Trailer","name":"The Punisher (2004) Trailer","ytId":"TqVSFchQEyM","lang":"en"},{"source":"jNT92z4NGSQ","type":"Trailer","name":"The Punisher Trailer HQ (2004)","ytId":"jNT92z4NGSQ","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"TqVSFchQEyM","title":"The Punisher (2004) Tr